# Graphify ignore — ONLY backend/ and frontend/ are product code.
# Everything else (docs/, study-guide, openspec, root artifacts, uploads) is out.
# NOTE: negations must NOT start with "/" — graphify strips the "!" and a
# leading "/" then re-anchors the pattern, which would only re-include the
# exact dir and never its contents (fnmatch crosses "/", so "/*" swallows
# everything at any depth). Unanchored "!backend" matches by path parts.
/*
!backend
!frontend

# --- noise inherited from .gitignore that applies INSIDE backend/frontend ---
**/.env
**/*.py[cod]
**/__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.angular/
dist/
backend/uploads/
frontend/test-results/
frontend/playwright-report/
**/coverage/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db